-1-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788791338.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":150,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-07 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet 22","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":150}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":617,"name":"NIEBO NAD NORMANDI\u0104  napisy ","description":"<div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Trzymaj\u0105cy w napi\u0119ciu film oparty na prawdziwych, nieopowiedzianych dot\u0105d kulisach desantu wojsk alianckich w Normandii w 1944 roku. \u201eNiebo nad Normandi\u0105\u201d to opowie\u015b\u0107 o odpowiedzialno\u015bci i o tym, jak jeden cz\u0142owiek mo\u017ce wp\u0142yn\u0105\u0107 na bieg historii. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych: mistrz z\u0142o\u017conych r\u00f3l, charyzmatyczny Andrew Scott (\u201eDobrzy nieznajomi\u201d), zdobywca Oscara Brendan Fraser (\u201eWieloryb\u201d), laureat nagrody Emmy oraz Z\u0142otego Globu Damian Lewis (\u201eHomeland\u201d) oraz wszechstronna Kerry Condon (\u201eF1\u201d). Za kamer\u0105 stan\u0105\u0142 Anthony Maras, re\u017cyser przejmuj\u0105cego thrillera, opartego na faktach \u201eHotelu Mumbai\u201d.<\/span><\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"Pressure","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat, wojenny","director":"Anthony Maras","organizer":"Eric Fellner","country":"Wielka Brytania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":100,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788791338.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":1,"name":"Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"Suchedniowski O\u015brodek Kultury Ku\u017anica","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Suchedni\u00f3w","city_id":2191,"zip":"26-130","addresse":"Bodzenty\u0144ska 18"}},"3952":{"id":3952,"title":"LALKA  Premiera! ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-premiera-2026-10-02-16-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740089.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":150,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet 22","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":150}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":620,"name":"LALKA  Premiera! ","description":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; font-family: Arial, Verdana;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"Lalka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"Maciej Kawalski","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740089.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":1,"name":"Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"Suchedniowski O\u015brodek Kultury Ku\u017anica","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Suchedni\u00f3w","city_id":2191,"zip":"26-130","addresse":"Bodzenty\u0144ska 18"}},"3953":{"id":3953,"title":"LALKA  Premiera! ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-premiera-2026-10-02-16-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740089.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":150,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet 22","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":150}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":620,"name":"LALKA  Premiera! ","description":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; font-family: Arial, Verdana;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"Lalka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"Maciej Kawalski","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740089.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":1,"name":"Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"Suchedniowski O\u015brodek Kultury Ku\u017anica","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Suchedni\u00f3w","city_id":2191,"zip":"26-130","addresse":"Bodzenty\u0144ska 18"}},"3954":{"id":3954,"title":"LALKA  Premiera! ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-premiera-2026-10-02-16-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740089.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":144,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet 22","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":144}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":620,"name":"LALKA  Premiera! ","description":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; font-family: Arial, Verdana;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"Lalka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"Maciej Kawalski","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740089.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":1,"name":"Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"Suchedniowski O\u015brodek Kultury Ku\u017anica","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Suchedni\u00f3w","city_id":2191,"zip":"26-130","addresse":"Bodzenty\u0144ska 18"}},"3955":{"id":3955,"title":"LALKA  Premiera! ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-premiera-2026-10-02-16-00-2-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740089.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":150,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 18:00:00","start